# LF everywhere on checkout (Windows autocrlf would break byte-exact PAGE assembly and parsers); later rules override.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.png binary
*.gif binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
# git archive ships the public set only: every .distignore path is export-ignore (keep the two in sync).
